OL,3,GNEWSARural areas may suffer in merger,
OL,4,Apolice chief warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police chief has warned that plans to
OL,7,Freduce the number of forces in England
OL,8,Fand Wales could cause rural communities
OL,9,Fto suffer.
OL,11,FThe Home Secretary Shabana Mahmood said
OL,12,Fearlier this year that she wanted to
OL,13,Fdrastically reduce the number of police
OL,14,Fforces in England to make them more
OL,15,Fefficient.
OL,17,FSuffolk's Conservative police and crime
OL,18,Fcommissioner, Tim Passmore, told the
OL,19,FSuffolk Police and Crime Panel he was
OL,20,Funconvinced the plans would deliver
OL,21,Fbetter outcomes.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
